# Line-ending policy for the public fork.
#
# Repository blobs are normalized to LF (text=auto); a Windows checkout may
# convert them back to CRLF through core.autocrlf. Content comparisons in
# reports/scripts/verify-tree.py therefore strip CR before hashing.
# See docs/HISTORY-RECONSTRUCTION.md.

* text=auto

# Binary artifacts and test vectors must never be line-ending converted.
*.bin binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.pdb binary
*.dat binary
